From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LNPANDY <lnp-andy@hotmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 16:50:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ios/scripts: append developer Team ID to default single-game
 bundle IDs

Append .<TEAM_ID> to default single-game iOS bundle IDs when a real Apple team is resolved (explicit, saved custom/pinned IDs, Mac apps, and shell frameworks keep theirs), auto-detect a sole local Apple Development / iPhone Developer OU team ID on Darwin --prepare-xcode when no team is set, and align build_ipa.sh defaults while preserving increased-memory-limit entitlements.

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: Append the developer Team ID to default single-game iOS bundle identifiers so personal teams avoid global App ID namespace collisions out of the box
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#1143

